Title: Collie Kart Portable P001

Summary: MK7-specific UI-only systems test

Description: |
    Verifies Mario Kart 7's Title ID and draws a small status
    label on the bottom screen. Provides a READY/INACTIVE toggle
    and diagnostics menu. No game-memory edits, input injection,
    training, or SD file writes.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
